style='font-size:12.0pt'>      Scripture does not readily adapt itself to the
eons of time projected for accomplishing what evolutionary theory postulates,
particularly in the biosphere. With varying degrees of likelihood, certain
possibilities might push the date A.M. beyond the 4000 + B.C. minimum reading
of scripture as in fiat creationism.&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>BASIC CONCEPTS IN CREATIONIST-EVOLUTIONARY THOUGHT</title><link>https://christir.org/essays/evidences/creation-and-evolution/basic-concepts-in-creationist-evolutionary-thought/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://christir.org/essays/evidences/creation-and-evolution/basic-concepts-in-creationist-evolutionary-thought/</guid><description>&lt;style>
